@startuml
title Activity Diagram: 1. Feature Branch Workflow

|Developer|
start

' Start of "Feature Branch Workflow" partition from original diagram
:Writes code (Frontend/Backend);
:Commits and pushes changes to Feature Branch;

|Git/GitHub|
:Receives push to Feature Branch;
:Triggers Jenkins (Feature Pipeline);

|Jenkins (CI/CD Pipeline)|
:Pipeline for Feature Branch starts;
:Checkout source code from Feature Branch;

fork
  group Frontend Build & Unit/Component Tests
    :Build Vue.js application;
    :Run Frontend Unit/Component tests;
    if (Frontend tests pass?) then (yes)
      ' Successfully tested
    else (no)
      :Notify developer of Frontend test failure on Feature Branch;
      end
    endif
  end group
fork again
  group Backend Build & Unit/Intra-Service Tests
    :Build Backend microservice(s);
    :Run Backend Unit/Component tests (pytest);
    :Run Backend Intra-Service Integration Tests (e.g., with Testcontainers);
    if (Backend tests pass?) then (yes)
      ' Successfully tested
    else (no)
      :Notify developer of Backend test failure on Feature Branch;
      end
    endif
  end group
end fork

|Jenkins (CI/CD Pipeline)|
if (All tests on Feature Branch pass?) then (yes)
  :Feature Branch is stable and ready for integration into Develop;
  |Developer|
  :Merges/Integrates Feature Branch code into Develop Branch;
  note right: This action triggers the "Develop Branch Workflow"
  '(Process for integrating feature into develop)
else (no)
  :Developer addresses issues on Feature Branch;
  end 
endif
' End of "Feature Branch Workflow" partition from original diagram

stop
@enduml